            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mrow
                    %mn ∞
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} {}_\infty
            ” indicates that associativity is relaxed up to higher homotopies without bound on the degree of the homotopies.
          %p
